2 CONT
2 CONT  Knut ÅGESSON b: ABT 1570 in Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT  Kari* ÅGESDATTER b: 1575 in Indre Nessa farm, Nedstrand, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
