2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Per was from Aga, br. 4.  He had inherited land from his father, plus through his wife -- so he was a rich man.  He was church ombudsman 1627-30 and lensmann 1633-35. At his skifte 9 November 1660, he had property in: Hovland, Ovr
2 CONC e Borve, Egdetveit, Selje, Nesheim paa Voss, Trappetun, Vasstun, N. Borve, Apold, Helleland, Vassvik, Reiseter, Skjelvik, Bu, Lydvo, Saeve and Souptad.
2 CONT
2 CONT From Ullensvang bygdebok (Olav Kolltveit), vol. IV, book 1.
