1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders found his bride on the Maeland farm and they took over Tjugum farm #1 in about 1654. Brita was the sister of Truls who moved to Ulvestad.
2 CONT
2 CONT As per Jerry Rowe: The Tjugum Farm becomes two ‘sub-farms’ (1677). Anders gets one, and brother Nils gets the other. Anders and Nils are related to Bjarne Brelid. Ander’s son Jon continues as Sheriff for a short time.
2 CONT
2 CONT === Bygdebok for Balestrand ===
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the [https://www.nb.no/items/URN:NBN:no-nb_digibok_2016062748127?page=127 Bygdebok], Anders had two wives, and Jon, Ola, and Thuri were born to the second.  Ola wound up in Valsvik.  Furhtermore, it is assumed that th
2 CONC e second wife Ragnhild came from elsewhere, which means that her surname of Tjugum should be removed.
