1 NOTE {geni:about_me} History: The name was written Affedal in 1598, Affuedal 1603, Affdal 1666, and Afdahlen 1723. The name is simply enough, meaning a farm far away from people. The first owners we know of is from Luster County, proba
2 CONC bly they used it as a mountain pasture. In 1645 we find Johannes Fortun as the owner, but he sold in 1680 to his son Søren Johanneson and he sold to Søren Jenson and he sold to his son in-law Dominikus Nagel at Årdalstangen
2 CONT --------------------
