2 CONT Bård Sigurdson Torsnes
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: 1380-1390, Torsnes
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: 1409
2 CONT
2 CONT Died: 1452
2 CONT
2 CONT    General Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT Han levde i 1410-46. Bård åtte meir enn 50 gardar. Han hadde ingen søner, men døtre.
2 CONT
2 CONT REFN: JO:55/702 GD 
2 CONT
2 CONT    Marriage Information:
2 CONT
2 CONT Bård married Gyrid Thorbergsdtr Berge, daughter of Torberg Håkonsson Berge and Gudrun Toresdtr Brandvik, in 1409. (Gyrid Thorbergsdtr Berge was born in 1403 in Torsnes and died in 1458 in Torsnes.)
2 CONT
2 CONT http://perso.wanadoo.fr/kelly.petit/1887.htm
