2 CONT Bård married Gyrid Thorbergsdtr Berge, daughter of Torberg Håkonsson Berge and Gudrun Toresdtr Brandvik, in 1409. (Gyrid Thorbergsdtr Berge was born in 1403 in Torsnes and died in 1458 in Torsnes.)
