1 NAME Hans Olsson /Straumøy/
2 GIVN Hans Olsson
2 SURN Straumøy
2 _MARNM Straumøy
2 NICK Hans Olson
2 NICK Hans Olsson Straumøy
2 NICK Hans Olsson Strømøen Straumly
1 SEX M
