2 CONC  Gabriel got bøgsel 1692, led to 1719, widow to 1721. Born:  a. Tolleiv, b.1700, Bokn.  b. Marit, g.m. Mons Hansson Vestre Bore, g.2) m. Klaus Hansson Vestre Bore.  c. Anna, b.1703, g.m. Erik Tjerandson Seland, Time, g.2) m. Rasmu
