1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ludvig_Rosenkrantz
2 CONT
2 CONT Ludvig Rosenkrantz (født 28. april 1628 i Odense, død 23. august 1685 i Kristiansand) var en dansk-norsk lensbaron, stiftamtmand og gehejmeråd.
2 CONT
2 CONT Han var søn af oberst Holger Rosenkrantz og Justina Ursula van der Lauwick. Ludvig Rosenkrantz' karriere syntes tidligt at skulle være militærvejen. Allerede før Christian 4.’s død havde han fået fændriks gage til ophold i udlande
2 CONC t for sin militære uddannelse, og dette fortsatte under Frederik 3. Efter hjemkomsten fik han 1654 bestalling at være skibskaptajn, 1658 blev han krigskommissær nordenfjelds (til 1661) og drog samtidig til Trondheim med den troppe
2 CONC afdeling, som sendtes dertil for at tilbageerobre byen fra svenskerne, der overgav den i december 1658. 1671 blev han vicegeneralkommissarius, og 1673 blev han amtmand i Stavanger Amt og assessor i overhofretten samt generalkommis
2 CONC sarius. 1680 stiftamtmand i Kristiansands Stift, men flyttede dog først i 1684 fra Stavanger til Kristiansand. Samme år udnævnt til ridder af Dannebrog. I Kristiansand modtog han det følgende år Christian 5. ved dennes besøg i Nor
2 CONC ge, men døde kort efter sammesteds 23. august 1685 efter langvarig svagelighed.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ludvig Rosenkrantz var ca. 1657 blevet gift med den på det tidspunkt rigeste arving i Norge, jomfru Karen Axelsdatter Movat, datter af Axel Movat til Hovland m.m. Ægteskabet var særdeles fordelagtigt for den forholdsvis fattige Ro
2 CONC senkrantz. Således fik han et betydeligt jordegods i Bergens Stift. 14. januar 1678 blev han ophøjet i friherrestanden som baron til Baroniet Rosendal. Rosendal blev oprettet af tre af hans sædegårde, Hatteberg, Mel og Sem, med un
2 CONC derliggende gods. Han beboede Hatteberg, hvor han i begyndelsen af 1660'erne opførte den endnu bevarede, prægtige hovedbygning. 1679 blev han gehejmeråd. Formentlig samtidig indgik han sit andet ægteskab; den første hustru Karen M
2 CONC ovat var død 1675. Den nye hustru var dronning Charlotte Amalies kammerjomfru Clara Catharina von Stockhausen (død 1689). Ludvig Rosenkrantz regnes ved skatteansættelsen i 1676 for en af landets rigeste mænd, men alligevel var han
2 CONC s økonomiske forhold ved hans død temmelig dårlige. Alle hans fire sønner døde uden afkom, den sidste 1723. Hermed uddøde denne norske gren af den danske adelsslægt.
2 CONT **
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Ludvig Rosenkrantz''', Baron of Rosendal (1628-1685)
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of [http://www.geni.com/people/Holger-Rosenkrantz/6000000003645929363  Holger Rosenkrantz] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Justine-Ursula-van-der-Lauwick/6000000003645929338 Justine Maximilian Mary van der Lauwick] 
2 CONC and belonged to a prominent [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Denmark Danish] noble family, but was himself indebted. He had in his youth been abroad to learn the art of battle and was later linked to the Norwegian army. In 1658 he wa
2 CONC s appointed war commissioner of Nordenfjells, which included the west coast, with a salary of 1200 rdl. The same year he would re-conquest [http://no.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trondhjems_len Trondhjems len], which had fallen into the han
2 CONC ds of the Swedes at the [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Treaty_of_Roskilde Treaty of Roskilde]. He was in 1673 appointed as general war commissioner and district governor of [http://no.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stavanger_amt Stavanger Amt]
2 CONC . In 1680 he was appointed Prefect of Stavanger stiftamt and it was in his time, according to King's letter of 06.05.1682, it was finally decided that Stavanger Amt hereinafter to be called [http://no.wikipedia.org/wiki/Christians
2 CONC and_stift Christiansand Amt], and that both the governor and the bishop were to stay in city.
2 CONT
2 CONT During a ball at the fortress of [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bergenhus_fortress Bergenhus] he met Karen Axelsdatter Mowat, sole heiress to the largest fortune in  [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norway Norway]. Her father, [http:/
2 CONC /www.geni.com/people/Axel-Mowat/289226275560008023 Axel Andersen Mowat] was a great land-owner who had more than 550 farms all over the western part of Norway. They married in 1658, and were given the farm of Hatteberg as a weddin
2 CONC g present. In 1661, Ludwig started building his own manor house [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barony_Rosendal Rosendal] after the death of his father in-law. It had cost a lot of money, so he had to sell the lands to manage the de
2 CONC bt. Despite owning the large estate and holding good offices, he was constantly in money difficulties.
2 CONT
2 CONT He completed the manor house in 1665 and 1678 [http://www.geni.com/people/Christian-V-king-of-Denmark-and-Norway/4104893 King Christian V of Denmark and Norway] gave the estate the status of barony, (the only one of its kind in No
2 CONC rway) under the name Glacier with Hatteberg as the manor and Mel and Shem as seat farms. The Barony total debt was 231 låper, 3 spand and 10 merker smør, equal to 579 barrels and 3 quarters hartkorn. King's conditions was that the
2 CONC  Barony would only be handed down in patrilineal descent and could not be mortgaged or sold.
2 CONT
2 CONT Karen died in Kristiania ([http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oslo Oslo]) in 1675 and in 1679 he was married again to Clara Catharina von Stockhausen , who had been a chamber maid at the [http://www.geni.com/people/Charlotte-Amalie-of-H
2 CONC esse-Cassel/4104973 Queen Charlotte Amalie] . With her he had no children.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children===
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Karen Mowat (1622-1675)
2 CONT
2 CONT # Justine Catharine Rosenkrantz
2 CONT # Frederik Rosenkrantz
2 CONT # Rigborg Rosenkrant
2 CONT # Holger Rosenkrantz
2 CONT # Christian Rosenkrantz
2 CONT # Axel Rosenkrantz
2 CONT # Charlotte Amalie Rosenkrantz
2 CONT # Sophie Amalie Rosenkrantz
2 CONT # Maximilian Rosenkrantz 
2 CONT
