1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Barbara Sinclair'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Barbara Sinclair is not mentioned in any contemporary sources.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bartholomew Mowat was probably the ancestor of the Hugoland Mowats. He is not mentioned in any contemporary sources and therefore probably died young. There is no doubt that his son, Andrew, was a close relative to the Balquholly 
2 CONC family, and Bartholomew therefore probably was a younger son of Magnus of Balquholly. Bartholomew Mowat married Barbara Sinclair, who neither is mentioned in any contemporary sources. But Andrew Mowat's coat of arms shows that his
2 CONC  mother was probably a Sinclair.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Possible sources==
2 CONT * [http://www.nermo.org/slekt/d0025/g0000091.html#I32342 nermo.org]: Daughter of Alexander Sinclair
2 CONT
2 CONT [3494] Ravensheug er et område rundt slottet Ravenscraig i Fife, Skottland, som var hovedsete til Lord Sinclair, som hørte til hovedgrenen i Sinclairætta.  Lord Sinclair angis enkelte steder som Barbara's far, mens andre angir Ale
2 CONC xander Sinclaire på Dunbeath i Skottland.  Hvis denne kilden har rett, så hørte nok også Alexander til en sidegrein av Sinclairætta eller kanskje til selve hovedgreinen. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Barbara er antakelig en kusine, tremenning, el.l. av Agnes Sinclair,  som var moren til [http://www.geni.com/people/Sir-James-Hepburn-1535/6000000001723257706 James Hepburn, jarlen av Bothwell], som hadde vært gift med Anna Christ
2 CONC offersdatter Tronds.
2 CONT
