2 CONT Johannes is last mentioned in 1658. His wife is mentioned as a widow in 1663.[1]</line><line /><line /><line /><line /><line>Transcript from Vats Kyrkje 100 years by the writing board FR. Eidhammer edition of Vats Sokneråd 1955 pa
2 CONC ge 50 states where Johannes Stokka was probably born in the 1580s and died in 1658. From other sources we know that he must have been married to Brynhild Knudsdatter Stokka probably in 1609 and with her he was to have 28 children.
2 CONC  It may sound incredible, but in the aforementioned transcript from the church it says that the second epitaph represents "Portrait of one's husband and a wife's 28 children on Gaarde Stokke in Vads Sogn til Skjold". It is forever
2 CONC  an old tradition that has been known in Vats until today. We also know that Brynhild Knutsdatter was quite young when she was married. She was probably born around 1590 and died in 1664. We know little about Johannes Åsmundson St
2 CONC okka's family. He has a brother Jon who lives on Nes in Vikedal, and was married to Eli Stokka, a sister of Brynhild Knutsdatter Stokka .............. Further down it says that the father-in-law Knut (Knud) must presumably be born
2 CONC  1570. Shipwreck in Vats November 8, 1621, Johannes Stokka has had some letters read about the transfer of some landed property. Of which something in Ile which was his "Werfadr Knud Thorgielsens Rette Odel". From this one knows t
2 CONC hat the wife is called Torgils og odelsgodset and other things make it natural that he is the son of Torgils Aslakson on Elleflot who originally comes from an old family from Tveit in Skjold and is mentioned there in a probate let
2 CONC ter from 1597. Knut's wife is not known but has two daughters Brynhild and named Brønla / Brønnela and Eli Knudsdatter married to Jon (Jone) Nes in Vikedal. transcript C.N. 14.02.2013</line><line /><line>As it appears from the exc
2 CONC erpt from Soga about Vats below, Johannes and his brother are MAYBE from Vikedal. There are many indications that someone who has introduced genealogies here in Geni has found an Osmund from Vikedal and guessed that he is the fath
2 CONC er. But that seems unlikely, as Osmund / Asmund from Viland according to the information was around 65 years old and his wife from Ile was just over 60 years old when Johannes was born.</line><line /><line /><line>https://www.geni
2 CONC .com/people/Johannes-Stokka-Vats/6000000002492175066</line><line /><line>Johannes Osmundsson Stokka, Vats</line><line /><line />
