2 CONT * Anders g1m: Guri Nilsdatter (her 2nd marriage) at Støle Nedre, Tysnes:
2 CONT ** https://www.nb.no/items/9cae9f871313295152f2960aa51d7f90?page=223&searchText=St%C3%B8le
2 CONT ** Guri Nilsdtr (g1.m.Jorgen Hansson Støle Nedre (f.o.1676 Mjovotna,d.1728) "who must have been from Flakka gmlt. Bnr.2".  Jorgen took skifte at N.Stole I 1705, died 1728.
2 CONT ** Guri married Anders Ellingsen Tveit S. (f.o.~1696,d.o.1756)  br#1 in 1730
2 CONT ** Guri died 1734 and Anders married enkja Kristi Jonsdatter Hovland
2 CONT ** Anders had been a soldier and military leader and they lived at Hovland.
2 CONT ** Guri had 6 barn w/Jorgen, none w/Anders according to bygdebok.  However, they were married for about 4 years before she died.  And, Anders did not later have a son "Elling" with Kristi, so it could be that Guri had a son "Ellin
2 CONC g" or more children even.
2 CONT
