2 CONT
2 CONT Copy of a small part of "A clear logbook on the divine goods and annual income, as the cancers, the supreme priests and the churches follow, and bring forth the staff of Stuart." It is from approx. 1587-1598. Danish Cancellation, 
2 CONC Issues 9, Package 133I, Litra F.
